/* 我的成长仪表盘（Figma 648:1439）：四类线索 2×2 选择块（选中青瓷描边）；现在可以做什么（唯一实心）；
   情绪温度条；近期情绪线索；记录与练习竹节时间线；各分区空状态。 */
page {
  background: var(--p3-paper);
}

.growth-page {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-section);
  box-sizing: border-box;
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 16rpx var(--p3-page-x) calc(72rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  background: var(--p3-paper);
  overflow-x: hidden;
}

.growth-intro {
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: -28rpx;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.growth-tiles {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.growth-tile {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4rpx;
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 0;
  padding: 28rpx 32rpx;
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-tile);
  background: var(--p3-surface);
  text-align: left;
}

.growth-tile--active {
  background: var(--p3-soft);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 3rpx var(--p3-primary);
}

.growth-tile__head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  color: var(--p3-ink);
}

.growth-tile--active .growth-tile__head {
  color: var(--p3-primary);
}

.growth-tile__label {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
  font-size: 32rpx;
  line-height: 48rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.growth-tile__count {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  font-family: var(--p3-font-serif);
  font-size: 48rpx;
  line-height: 64rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 1rpx;
}

.growth-tile__hint {
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.growth-next {
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.growth-next__kicker {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.growth-next__text {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 40rpx;
  line-height: 56rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.growth-section {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
  min-width: 0;
}

.growth-section__head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.growth-section__header {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
}

.growth-section__pill {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}

.growth-bar-row {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 12rpx;
  padding: 22rpx 0;
}

.growth-bar-row--divided {
  box-shadow: inset 0 -2rpx 0 var(--p3-hairline);
}

.growth-bar-row__head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.growth-bar-row__date {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
}

.growth-bar-row__value {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.growth-bar {
  height: 12rpx;
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  background: var(--p3-mist);
}

.growth-bar__fill {
  height: 12rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
}

.growth-bar__fill--primary {
  background: var(--p3-intensity-1);
}

.growth-insights {
  padding: 24rpx 32rpx;
}

.growth-insights__summary {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
}

.growth-insights__label {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 16rpx;
  color: var(--p3-primary);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.growth-insights__line {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
}

.growth-timeline {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.growth-assessment {
  padding: 24rpx 32rpx;
}

.growth-assessment__title {
  display: block;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 32rpx;
  line-height: 48rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.growth-assessment__row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  padding: 16rpx 0;
  box-shadow: inset 0 -2rpx 0 var(--p3-hairline);
}

.growth-assessment__date {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
}

.growth-assessment__value {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.growth-assessment__note {
  display: block;
  padding-top: 16rpx;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.growth-cells {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: var(--p3-stack);
}

.growth-cell {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4rpx;
  min-width: 0;
  padding: 28rpx;
  border-radius: var(--p3-radius-group);
  background: var(--p3-surface);
}

.growth-cell__value {
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-family: var(--p3-font-serif);
  font-size: 48rpx;
  line-height: 64rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.growth-cell__label {
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}
